  "term": "organizational efficiency",
  "definition": "Organizational efficiency refers to how well an organization functions in carrying out its work and maintaining its standards. In this packet, it is linked to public hospitals’ ability to support high-quality patient care and avoid staff behaviors that undermine services.",
